*train.jsonl
*validation.jsonl
*benchmark.jsonl
*train_prepare.jsonl
*validation_prepare.jsonl
*example_prepare.jsonl

# Prepared batches may carry private reference/deliverable data (prepared JSONL
# is written 0600). Never commit a source CSV, a prepared subset JSONL, or a
# reference-override map. Kept source-agnostic on purpose: patterns keyed to one
# supplier's filenames silently fail to protect a batch from anywhere else.
*.csv
*_prepare*.jsonl
*.reference_overrides.json
